1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:00,833
Turning your aircon

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:01,833
down to 18

3
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:02,666
won't cool you

4
00:00:02,666 --> 00:00:03,500
any faster

5
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,000
Your aircon

6
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,333
doesn't make cold

7
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:06,166
It pulls the heat

8
00:00:06,166 --> 00:00:07,333
out of your room

9
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:08,166
In here

10
00:00:08,166 --> 00:00:09,000
a fan drags

11
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:11,000
across ice-cold pipes

12
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,666
The pressure inside

13
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:12,833
is so low

14
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:13,500
the liquid boils

15
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,166
at just 5 degrees

16
00:00:15,166 --> 00:00:16,000
As it boils

17
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
it soaks up the heat

18
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,166
and turns to gas

19
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:18,833
Out here

20
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:19,333
a compressor

21
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:20,500
squeezes that gas

22
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,166
until it's scorching hot

23
00:00:22,166 --> 00:00:22,666
and the heat

24
00:00:22,666 --> 00:00:24,000
blasts outside

25
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,166
Then, a tiny valve

26
00:00:25,166 --> 00:00:26,333
drops the pressure

27
00:00:26,333 --> 00:00:26,833
and the liquid

28
00:00:26,833 --> 00:00:28,166
goes ice-cold again

29
00:00:28,166 --> 00:00:29,166
But it can only

30
00:00:29,166 --> 00:00:30,666
move heat so fast

31
00:00:30,666 --> 00:00:31,666
18 just keeps it

32
00:00:31,666 --> 00:00:32,500
running longer

33
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,666
and every degree lower

34
00:00:33,666 --> 00:00:35,000
adds up to 10%

35
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:35,833
to your bill

36
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:37,000
Set it to 25

37
00:00:37,166 --> 00:00:38,500
It cools just as fast

38
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,833
for a lot less

